Pasteboard boxes, cardboard boxes or other similar containers desired to be collected for recycling shall be prepared in the following manner:
(1) Cardboard boxes or other similar containers shall be flattened, cut if necessary and tied in bundles not exceeding 35 pounds and having no dimension exceeding 36 inches;
(2) The bundles shall be stacked in a manner that would permit convenient removal and placed in a location designated by the commissioner;
(3) Garbage, bits of paper and other debris shall not be placed in such containers or bundles.
